# Day 14 - AI Job Red Flag Detector

## Overview

Today I explored how AI can help job seekers evaluate job opportunities before applying.

Many candidates focus only on salary, job title, or company name. However, important warning signs often exist within job descriptions and company information.

To solve this problem, I used an AI-powered Job Red Flag Detector that analyzes job postings, hiring practices, company details, and workplace indicators to identify potential risks and opportunities.

---

## Project Objective

Build an AI system that can:

* Analyze job descriptions
* Evaluate company information
* Detect hiring risks
* Identify workplace red flags
* Assess role suitability
* Generate interview validation questions
* Support smarter career decisions

